WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.564
Age checks arrive

00:00:01.388 --> 00:00:02.213
in two big

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:02.755
states

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:04.178
New York and

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.428
California are putting

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:06.289
age gating rules

00:00:06.101 --> 00:00:07.020
into effect in

00:00:06.832 --> 00:00:07.586
the new year

00:00:07.775 --> 00:00:08.624
and the EFF

00:00:08.471 --> 00:00:09.426
has published an

00:00:09.237 --> 00:00:10.345
explainer on what

00:00:10.157 --> 00:00:11.077
they require

00:00:11.614 --> 00:00:12.474
The rules will

00:00:12.286 --> 00:00:13.901
affect online services

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:14.750
and their users

00:00:14.869 --> 00:00:16.142
changing how sites

00:00:15.954 --> 00:00:17.309
verify age before

00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:18.158
letting people in

00:00:18.686 --> 00:00:19.806
The details matter

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:20.714
now because the

00:00:20.526 --> 00:00:21.516
new year is

00:00:21.339 --> 00:00:22.542
only weeks away

00:00:22.353 --> 00:00:23.780
and services must

00:00:23.592 --> 00:00:24.275
be ready in

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:24.747
time

00:00:25.278 --> 00:00:26.292
Full story on

00:00:26.103 --> 00:00:26.999
the dashboard
